                                "sense_id": "91a316e8-3e62-3795-8432-977a659efb10",
                                "text": "As they thus pressed forward, longing doubtless to exchange the easy curving line, which the sinuosities of the bay compelled them to adopt, for a straiter and more expeditious path, though less conformable to the line of beauty, Sir Arthur observed a human figure on the beach advancing to meet them."
                            },
                            {
